---
    import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
    import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
    import SeoHead from '../components/SeoHead.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <SeoHead
            title="About Us | SafePlots | NRI Plot Monitoring, Fencing & VLT Services"
            description="Learn about SafePlots - India's trusted plot management service. Our mission, team, and commitment to protecting your land investments."
            canonical="https://safeplots.com/about/"
            keywords="Plot Monitoring, NRI Services, Land Fencing, Vacant Land Tax, Precast Walls, Survey Maps, Hyderabad Real Estate, Property Management, SafePlots"
        />
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />

        <!-- Our Story Section -->
        <section class="about-section story-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title text-center">Our Story</h2>
                <div class="story-content">
                    <p class="story-text text-mono">
                        SafePlots was born out of a simple need: to provide
                        peace of mind to plot owners, especially NRIs and
                        working professionals who struggle to maintain and
                        protect their land investments from afar.
                    </p>
                    <p class="story-text text-mono">
                        We recognized that plot ownership should be stress-free,
                        transparent, and professionally managed. Our platform
                        combines high-tech satellite monitoring with
                        ground-level physical protection to ensure your land
                        remains secure.
                    </p>
                    <p class="story-text text-mono">
                        Today, SafePlots stands as a symbol of trust — built by
                        professionals, strengthened by technology, and powered
                        by a shared mission:
                        <strong
                            >to protect the dreams of every landowner, one plot
                            at a time.</strong
                        >
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Our Journey Section -->
        <section class="about-section timeline-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title text-center">Our Journey</h2>
                <p class="section-intro text-mono text-center">
                    Building India's most trusted plot management platform
                </p>

                <div class="timeline-container">
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-year">2024</div>
                        <div class="timeline-content">
                            <h3 class="timeline-title">Company Founded</h3>
                            <p class="timeline-desc text-mono">
                                SafePlots was established with a vision to
                                provide professional plot management services
                                for NRIs & plot owners across India.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-year">Dec 2024</div>
                        <div class="timeline-content">
                            <h3 class="timeline-title">
                                Official Launch in Hyderabad
                            </h3>
                            <p class="timeline-desc text-mono">
                                Beginning operations in Hyderabad with full
                                suite of plot management services including
                                satellite monitoring, fencing, VLT services, and
                                legal verification.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-year">Q1 2025</div>
                        <div class="timeline-content">
                            <h3 class="timeline-title">
                                Expansion to Multiple Cities
                            </h3>
                            <p class="timeline-desc text-mono">
                                Expanding to Vijayawada, Guntur, and Vizag with
                                dedicated teams and complete service coverage.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Stats Section -->
        <section class="about-section stats-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title text-center">Stats</h2>

                <div class="stats-grid stats-grid-center">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">250+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label text-mono">Plots Secured</div>
                        <div class="stat-desc text-mono">
                            Active plots under management
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">4</div>
                        <div class="stat-label text-mono">Service Cities</div>
                        <div class="stat-desc text-mono">
                            Hyderabad, Vijayawada, Guntur & Vizag
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">24/7</div>
                        <div class="stat-label text-mono">Support System</div>
                        <div class="stat-desc text-mono">
                            Real-time monitoring & alerts
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Meet the Founding Team Section -->
        <section class="about-section team-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title text-center">Meet the Team</h2>
                <p class="section-intro text-mono text-center">
                    The professionals behind SafePlots
                </p>

                <div class="team-grid team-grid-single">
                    <div class="team-card">
                        <div class="team-avatar">👤</div>
                        <h3 class="team-name">
                            Kranthi Kumar Reddy Pamulapati
                        </h3>
                        <div class="team-role text-mono">Founder</div>
                        <div class="team-bio text-mono">
                            Technical Operations, Marketing & Business Strategy
                        </div>
                        <p class="team-desc text-mono">
                            Visionary entrepreneur with deep understanding of
                            digital systems, customer psychology, and
                            ground-level business execution.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Mission & Vision Section -->
        <section class="about-section mission-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="mission-grid">
                    <div class="mission-card">
                        <h3 class="mission-title">Our Mission</h3>
                        <p class="mission-text text-mono">
                            To provide peace of mind to plot owners through
                            professional, transparent, and technology-driven
                            management services. We aim to be the most trusted
                            partner for land management in India, ensuring every
                            landowner can protect their investment without
                            stress or uncertainty.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mission-card">
                        <h3 class="mission-title">Our Vision</h3>
                        <p class="mission-text text-mono">
                            To revolutionize plot ownership in India by
                            combining technology, trust, and professional
                            service. We envision a future where every plot
                            owner, whether in India or abroad, has complete
                            confidence and control over their land through our
                            comprehensive management platform.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Trust & Credentials + Core Values Section -->
        <section class="about-section trust-values-section">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title text-center">Trust & Credentials</h2>
                <p class="section-intro text-mono text-center">
                    Built on a foundation of transparency, legal compliance, and
                    professional excellence.
                </p>

                <div class="trust-grid trust-grid-4">
                    <div class="trust-card">
                        <div class="trust-icon">🏢</div>
                        <h3 class="trust-title">Registered Company</h3>
                        <p class="trust-desc text-mono">
                            SafePlots is a legally registered company operating
                            under Indian corporate law with full compliance and
                            transparency.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="trust-card">
                        <div class="trust-icon">⚖️</div>
                        <h3 class="trust-title">Legal Partnerships</h3>
                        <p class="trust-desc text-mono">
                            Strategic partnerships with property lawyers and
                            surveyors to provide expert legal support for
                            documentation and dispute resolution.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="trust-card">
                        <div class="trust-icon">👥</div>
                        <h3 class="trust-title">Verified Team Members</h3>
                        <p class="trust-desc text-mono">
                            Every field supervisor undergoes background
                            verification, professional training, and follows
                            strict code of conduct protocols.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="trust-card">
                        <div class="trust-icon">🛰️</div>
                        <h3 class="trust-title">Technology Partners</h3>
                        <p class="trust-desc text-mono">
                            Collaborating with leading satellite monitoring
                            companies and geospatial technology providers for
                            accurate property documentation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2 class="section-title text-center mt-80">Core Values</h2>
                <p class="section-intro text-mono text-center">
                    The principles that guide our every action.
                </p>

                <div class="values-grid">
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">🛡️</div>
                        <h3 class="value-title">Trust & Security</h3>
                        <p class="value-desc text-mono">
                            We treat your property with the same care and
                            vigilance as our own.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">🔍</div>
                        <h3 class="value-title">Transparency</h3>
                        <p class="value-desc text-mono">
                            No hidden fees, no fake reports. Every visit is
                            documented and verifiable.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">👥</div>
                        <h3 class="value-title">Customer First</h3>
                        <p class="value-desc text-mono">
                            Our support team is always available to address your
                            concerns and queries.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">⚡</div>
                        <h3 class="value-title">Reliability</h3>
                        <p class="value-desc text-mono">
                            We show up when we say we will. Consistency is key
                            to our service.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        
        <Footer />

        <script src="/src/scripts/app.js?v=20260210"></script>
        <script src="/src/scripts/posthog-init.js?v=20260210"></script>
    </body>
</html>
